{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Creature-Collector Roguelike Deckbuilding Game. Assemble your team of three Montabi so that you can outsmart the bad guys and save the city!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/ed8c0aba2ef293a86eb4db003d3dd38a.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/ed8c0aba2ef293a86eb4db003d3dd38a.webm?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/55308a2efab6bf0ec0b8c36620784d37.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/55308a2efab6bf0ec0b8c36620784d37.webm?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/55308a2efab6bf0ec0b8c36620784d37.mp4?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're going to be the big hero and save the city, you've gotta get some Montabi! Each Montabi has a unique set of skills, giving you and your party of three endless combinations of options and synergies. Collect gadgets, equip charms, and chart the path to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/0fd769591e4155e0f4ec97dae32ded74.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/0fd769591e4155e0f4ec97dae32ded74.webm?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/93110bb68727bf9b6bff879acdb11d6e.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/93110bb68727bf9b6bff879acdb11d6e.webm?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/93110bb68727bf9b6bff879acdb11d6e.mp4?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your Montabi to grow stronger, unlocking new moves to enhance your team's strategy. As they level up, your Montabi evolve into more powerful forms, gaining new card abilities and expanding your tactical options. If you work together, there's nothing you and your Montabi can't achieve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/89437119c6cd7fe32a723c143997ad8d.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=169 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/89437119c6cd7fe32a723c143997ad8d.webm?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/2b72b0ef9de49a3d265f3e266e902427.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/2b72b0ef9de49a3d265f3e266e902427.webm?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/2b72b0ef9de49a3d265f3e266e902427.mp4?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your best strategies to beat up the bad guys in a unique 3x3 grid-based system. With every Montabi's unique abilities, you'll have endless options to outthink the competition and win the day. Just make sure you rest up at a cafe every now and then to recover those hit points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/c797d05bf8de5e5f854f54fca7dfec88.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=169 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/c797d05bf8de5e5f854f54fca7dfec88.webm?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/c65c1a513196816d47e0cc932bfef3de.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/c65c1a513196816d47e0cc932bfef3de.webm?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/c65c1a513196816d47e0cc932bfef3de.mp4?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from diverse trainers, each with a unique playstyle. Do you wanna put your team in the perfect position, get right up in their faces and duke it out, or buff up your Montabi with a hearty meal? When the city's at stake, everyone pitches in! Just make sure to stay safe! Like the king in chess, if your trainer is defeated, the game ends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/990ae8e1e478a9c598e4c6fdeb340a5e.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/990ae8e1e478a9c598e4c6fdeb340a5e.webm?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/a2093d3f1e29559bcb1b7ef3388c666e.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/a2093d3f1e29559bcb1b7ef3388c666e.webm?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/a2093d3f1e29559bcb1b7ef3388c666e.mp4?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ Montabi planned for release, each with a unique and distinct playstyle. Choose your favorite!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3141630?t=1772843338","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772843338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/e5002162a583d7b2e0bcea5f916787c8e4ac9044/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772843338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/e5002162a583d7b2e0bcea5f916787c8e4ac9044/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772843338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3750130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and Fight with up to 40 Montabi!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your Montabi into more powerful companions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different Montabi into a strong, synergistic team!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize on the tactical 3x3 battlemap!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat down the big bad boss of the local X Gang!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out all the city has to offer in over 20 randomized events!</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Creature-Collector Roguelike Deckbuilding Game. Assemble your team of three Montabi so that you can outsmart the bad guys and save the city!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/ed8c0aba2ef293a86eb4db003d3dd38a.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/ed8c0aba2ef293a86eb4db003d3dd38a.webm?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/55308a2efab6bf0ec0b8c36620784d37.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/55308a2efab6bf0ec0b8c36620784d37.webm?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/55308a2efab6bf0ec0b8c36620784d37.mp4?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're going to be the big hero and save the city, you've gotta get some Montabi! Each Montabi has a unique set of skills, giving you and your party of three endless combinations of options and synergies. Collect gadgets, equip charms, and chart the path to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/0fd769591e4155e0f4ec97dae32ded74.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/0fd769591e4155e0f4ec97dae32ded74.webm?t=1772843338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/93110bb68727bf9b6bff879acdb11d6e.poster.avif?t=1772843338\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/93110bb68727bf9b6bff879acdb11d6e.webm?t=1772843338\" type